之，召執詢，馳使告宏，宏徙詢無鼻城，在河橋北二里，尋殺之，以庶人禮葬。立大馮為皇后，便立偽太子恪，是歲，偽太和二十年也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0026","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0011"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"同段分大小馮。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-qi057-feng-younger-spouse","subject_person_id":"qfs_0c0_p7d","object_person_id":"8dc_745_f37","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"小馮為宏皇后"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-057","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035","quote":"初，偽太后馮氏兄昌黎王馮莎二女，大馮美而有疾，為尼，小馮為宏皇后，生偽太子詢。後大馮疾差，宏納為昭儀。宏初徙都，詢意不樂，思歸桑乾。宏制衣冠與之，詢竊毀裂，解髮為編服左衽。大馮有寵，日夜讒詢。宏出鄴城馬射，詢因是欲叛北歸，密選宮中御馬三千疋置河陰渚。皇后聞之，召執詢，馳使告宏，宏徙詢無鼻城，在河橋北二里，尋殺之，以庶人禮葬。立大馮為皇后，便立偽太子恪，是歲，偽太和二十年也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0026","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0029"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句記皇后；後接太子母異說。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"小馮","kind":"person","person_id":"qfs_0c0_p7d","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035:m0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"qfs_0c0_p7d","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-qi057-